<item><title>Ivory Coast suspends influencer’s driving licence for four years</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-suspends-influencer-s-driving-licence-for-four-cb09be/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-suspends-influencer-s-driving-licence-for-four-cb09be/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The influencer admitted speeding at 120 km/h on a road limited to 100 km/h, and must return to driving school before regaining his licence.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:10:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ivory Coast foundation gives schools and clinics to 14 localities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-foundation-gives-schools-and-clinics-to-14-1bcc65/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-foundation-gives-schools-and-clinics-to-14-1bcc65/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The national lottery foundation handed over the facilities in Abidjan on Wednesday, with investment of more than CFA456 million across nine regions and districts.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:54:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Abidjan court postpones Songan forest gold-mining case to 10 December</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/abidjan-court-postpones-songan-forest-gold-mining-case-to-c9126f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/abidjan-court-postpones-songan-forest-gold-mining-case-to-c9126f/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The court delayed proceedings after no interpreter was available for two English-speaking defendants among the 12 people facing charges.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:48:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ivory Coast replaces 14 BTS fields with 16 new specialities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-replaces-14-bts-fields-with-16-new-specialities-bd7e6f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ci/ivory-coast-replaces-14-bts-fields-with-16-new-specialities-bd7e6f/</guid><category>Cote d&apos;Ivoire</category><description>The cabinet approved the overhaul in Abidjan, adding courses including cybersecurity and energy efficiency while modernising 19 existing fields.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:39:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" length="32300" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ci.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
